e dictates taking the west crossing (F1) and acting on enemy mail. Kite is at F1/N-west. I must reinforce F1. I have infantry and archers there already. I will move the cavalry to support the west crossing, as per doctrine."},{"seq":342,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c121","house":"rhino","letter":"L150","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":2100,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":343,"t":2100,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1778,"retries":0},{"seq":344,"t":2100,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Rhino is strong at F1 (West Ford). My infantry/archery at N-West/N-East can pressure F1. Kite Ele is fresh at Kite Camp. I will use decoys and double riders to probe Rhino's defenses while securing my positions."},{"seq":345,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c122","house":"kite","letter":"L151","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":2100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":346,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c123","house":"kite","letter":"L152","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":2100,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":347,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c124","house":"kite","letter":"L153","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","n-ferry"],"depart":2100,"plain":"HORSE, SCOUT NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":348,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c125","house":"kite","letter":"L154","kind":"letter","to":"rhino-camp","path":["kite-camp","north-village","rhino-camp"],"depart":2400,"plain":"WE SEEK PEACE","cipher":"WN RNNG MNTLN"},{"seq":349,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c126","house":"kite","letter":"L155","kind":"decoy","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":2100,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, ATTACK AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":350,"t":2100,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1786,"retries":0},{"seq":351,"t":2100,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino and Tiger forces are at F1/SWB. My forces are at Orchid Camp. I must move to secure F1 or F2. Tiger's orders to SWB are a big clue. I should move my main force towards F1/S-West to intercept or challenge them, using my strong units."},{"seq":352,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c127","house":"orchid","letter":"L156","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":2400,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":"RMOKJS AKKT, IBQOD TK WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":353,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c128","house":"orchid","letter":"L157","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":2400,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"LKWIMJ, IBQOD TK RKUTD LBJG WMRT."},{"seq":354,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c129","house":"orchid","letter":"L158","kind":"order","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village"],"depart":2400,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":"DKQRM, IBQOD TK WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":355,"t":2100,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1753,"retries":0},{"seq":356,"t":2100,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Watch 8. Doctrine: Take west ford (F1) in first 5 watches, hold it. F1 is at n-west/s-west. Tiger units are near s-west. Rhino has units at F1 (2w ago). I should reinforce F1 and pressure rhino there. Tiger-inf-1/arch-1/cav-1 are at s-west, near F1."},{"seq":357,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c130","house":"tiger","letter":"L159","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid","s-west"],"depart":2400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"ECNOQ EKKQ, BKGI SQ WPOQ EKNI."},{"seq":358,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c131","house":"tiger","letter":"L160","kind":"order","to":"tiger-arch-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid","s-west"],"depart":2400,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher